# sweep: --bare --seed-root examples/chat/fixtures/cut-short
# A reply that reached its length limit, saved before a restart, seeded in
# place of the default conversation. The route stops before Continue is
# tapped, so nothing is sent.
wait-for AI Command Center
wait-for so the flour can
expect Continue the answer
clean
shot continue-after-restart
# Back from the reader's keyboard returns to the reply, Continue intact.
tap Type
wait-for Type a message
clean
shot compose
tap Back
expect Continue the answer
